Donnie is a [[Org/Ghosts of Raelion|Ghost]], an old companion of [[People/Johnny|Johnny]] from [[Geography/Raelion/index|Raelion]]. He moves semi-translucent, mixing with the shadows around him.

After the Party joined [[Org/Iconoclasm/index|Iconoclasm]] he came in the night to Johnny's room at the [[Sin and Tonic]]. He said the Ghosts had found a mole among them and that he had split the survivors apart until he could name the traitor, that [[Org/Ghosts of Raelion|Red]] could not be reassigned and now works with him, and that the new firearms out of [[Org/Sable and Suns/index|Sable and Suns]] are the work of a consultant brought in from further down the horizon. He offered to ask after a way into the Teller's Run party, and left the price of his eggs on the table.
